      <title>WordPress Download Manager 3.3.5.2 — Unauthenticated IDOR (CVE-2026-39676)</title>
      <link>http://192.168.0.124:1313/pocs/web/2026-07-05_cve-2026-39676-wordpress-download-manager-idor/</link>
